\pard\sa120\sl240\slmult1\b\fs21\cf1 1. PRIVACY COMMITMENT & ZERO TELEMETRY\par
\b0\fs19\cf2 - \b 100% Local-First Storage:\b0  All your Panel credentials, Client API Keys, Application API Keys, SFTP passwords, and SQLite databases are stored strictly on your local machine (%APPDATA%\\SynoraDesk).\par
