- \b Zero Tracking / No Telemetry:\b0  No telemetry beacons, no user behavior tracking, and no advertisements.\par
\pard\sa120\sl240\slmult1\b\fs21\cf1 2. HARDWARE-LEVEL SECURITY WITH WINDOWS DPAPI\par
